	"data": "Institute of Science Tokyo — School of Computing\n\nPart of [[projects/grad-school-options|Grad School Options]] research. See also [[projects/mext-scholarship-2029|Mext Scholarship 2029]] for funding details.\n\nOverview\n\nInstitute of Science Tokyo (科学技術院) was formed on October 1, 2024, from the merger of Tokyo Institute of Technology and Tokyo Medical and Dental University — the first merger between designated national universities in Japan. The School of Computing has strong XR/VR labs including…",
